  "label": "Trans Hunting Stereotype",
  "description": "A derogatory and harmful metaphor that frames transgender individuals as targets to be found and attacked, often implying predatory intent. This stereotype is used to dehumanize and incite hostility toward transgender people, aligning with 'Predator/groomer accusations' under LGBTQ+ discrimination. It is a form of hate speech that promotes fear and violence against a protected community.",
